$t=0\\,\\text{s}$, find the velocity (in $\\text{m/s}$)  of the particle at time $t.$" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298720 1113 #uuid "9071dddd-e988-518c-b0c1-0a51bb716b1f" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298720 1145 "First, we find $v(t)$ by integrating the acceleration with respect to time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}v(t) & =\\int a(t)\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =\\int \\frac{1}{(t+1)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}t \\\\  & =-\\frac{1}{t+1}+C\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTo determine $C$, we use the fact that $v(0)=1.$ Substituting this into the above gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}1 & =-\\frac{1}{0+1}+C \\\\ 1 & =-1+C \\\\ C & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the velocity $v$ of the particle at time $t$ is $v(t)=-\\frac{1}{t+1}+2.$" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298722 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298723 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298724 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298725 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1000 #edb/ref 17592186298726 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1041 "selection" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1104 #edb/ref 17592186298723 13194139534611 true] [17592186298721 1110 #uuid "e1d051e3-5483-5035-ad12-b6f17449c8db" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298722 1034 "v(t)=\\frac{2}{t+1}" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298722 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534611 true] [17592186298722 1111 #uuid "767a7240-b523-5fca-81da-e6c8ec3f76f1" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298723 1034 "v(t)=-\\frac{1}{t+1}+2" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298723 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534611 true] [17592186298723 1111 #uuid "9faa52b1-9fe4-5577-9249-1fddaeae00cc" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298724 1034 "v(t)=\\frac{1}{t+1}" 13194139534611 true] [17592186298724 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534611 true] [17592186298724 1111 #uuid "6cfb5a46-1fe1-5b68-8709-706ac8fa98c2" 13194139534611 true] [175921862